                <l xml:id="m-0963e720-53dc-4912-980e-aa2b08432df0" facs="#m-bf0b1405-ed2a-45d4-99e4-8dd8ebd25fe0" label="text-like">lst Sunday of the Passion.</l><l xml:id="m-c7babc66-9fa6-46e5-96e2-eb70bc2c2046" facs="#m-03e69505-9589-4516-baa2-f280ff9009a1" label="ambiguous">569</l><l xml:id="m-42b5fd7c-fa04-4bbe-91ec-1f46ff53623a" facs="#m-55b2d760-3926-4a35-b6fd-7231879517c4" label="lyrics-like">Short Lesson. Fá̂ciem méam. D. 234. This Short Lesson is said in the</l><l xml:id="m-2d496c0a-4c8d-4378-b0d0-a997535856b0" facs="#m-de0ae248-c088-4ada-8f9f-908854f51760" label="text-like">Office ot the Time until Maundy Thursday exclusive.</l><l xml:id="m-33f3ad0a-bdc7-4a8d-b9a1-9797d0aa6a39" facs="#m-ac46b99d-a3d3-46db-9184-bdaf7d03816f" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-4946633d-cbf9-408c-936e-d21611a05591" facs="#m-06f4841e-a12c-423f-a001-34aa27e01458" label="ambiguous">Hymn.</l><l xml:id="m-318f236e-4ba8-429b-8c0a-b07a26492ea4" facs="#m-ef4f787c-c92e-4576-ad52-0334597447ef" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-bb59fe23-8963-4df9-a682-c1de2db830fc" facs="#m-e1784ac0-4aa1-4bd3-8933-5a001d31e24d" label="ambiguous">n</l><l xml:id="m-0ae3abe0-8edc-459d-b078-9b2164cec8fa" facs="#m-46633bb3-540b-4f7f-aa31-1a61a7e8afad" label="lyrics-like">Unc Sáncte nó-bis Spíri-tus, Unum Pátri cum Fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-96ed3dc2-d988-488e-851d-f014e24de709" facs="#m-5d7206b1-539f-4315-bbe6-2e488a296514" label="lyrics-like">li-o, Dignáre prómptus inge-ri, Nóstro re-fúsus pécto-ri.</l><l xml:id="m-b7c417df-7b23-4bda-82b6-96492e86e7ae" facs="#m-6eb541ff-5ece-42c2-836f-762041513440" label="lyrics-like">Praésta, Páter pisssime,</l><l xml:id="m-436e8e6d-f5c0-47bf-a412-c8c1be260f03" facs="#m-febb720a-ee9d-4255-89fd-a6e94693686e" label="lyrics-like">Os, língua, mens, sénsus, vígor!</l><l xml:id="m-ad6b9405-f288-4c3a-b14f-bd5d9f6b4884" facs="#m-7ada3fc5-2885-42a4-99bd-1a708fb8028c" label="lyrics-like">Confessiónem pérsonent:</l><l xml:id="m-8ff9f1cf-c81e-4072-b8eb-3a313fb2b21e" facs="#m-20cec79b-a952-40c1-9554-10cf4021889e" label="lyrics-like">Patrique cómpar Unice,</l><l xml:id="m-9149c9be-d61f-47ac-b84c-0f7562bf5fc1" facs="#m-adf33964-7689-40a2-ab3d-5e62b2e263e2" label="lyrics-like">Flamméscat igne cáritas,</l><l xml:id="m-a67f176a-fe33-4806-bcff-8d97cb927090" facs="#m-be6c6c05-81f9-49b0-9b18-476c88619ead" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spiritu Paráclito,</l><l xml:id="m-b7074f8e-ddac-429d-a0f6-f403cb0e90f8" facs="#m-592e4d04-4c16-41bb-abdd-e94e58c99bbc" label="lyrics-like">Accéndat árdor próximos.</l><l xml:id="m-5a63d2d2-4ba2-47c1-9be0-e513cf5d8c2b" facs="#m-e95b2897-b58b-4bf5-a00e-843ea3635b31" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ômne saéculum.</l><l xml:id="m-759bbe89-8331-410a-84c0-dbf92704f63b" facs="#m-9ab81b92-cd1e-43c6-971a-073aae877e24" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-cb7f8a95-9c03-485a-b26b-01443025c714" facs="#m-9ab15bbb-9f31-41e8-8d2c-59c0e39d991d" label="text-like">The Hymn ot the Little Hours is sung in this tone until Wednesday or</l><l xml:id="m-e0d8ec9b-f5e4-40d1-b4f0-f2515ba79396" facs="#m-f3470e57-7147-481f-8316-a31e6edea2a1" label="text-like">Holy Week, even on Feasts, unless the contrary be indicated.</l><l xml:id="m-b2395287-d609-43a8-97d0-ad62a720faa8" facs="#m-eeb6adc3-b1f9-4d57-9951-c9d9a31d878f" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-cc5a76f7-f287-407f-aaad-ca90b810d228" facs="#m-936c5f02-da44-4e1a-b2da-61daaf5d29d4" label="ambiguous">8. e</l><l xml:id="m-599a68df-fdb6-45f2-9aa4-4c56fb268e07" facs="#m-c6ad202a-8cfa-483d-8660-f15fdccf4935" label="lyrics-like">" gló-ri-am mé-am non quaé-ro:</l><l xml:id="m-b67c22aa-9adb-46e3-ae40-e959b274be0c" facs="#m-b89c6101-bb8b-4895-ad04-ac8720a239dc" label="ambiguous">est qui</l><l xml:id="m-619dac97-c493-444c-aadd-a11a57d283e7" facs="#m-a29183b9-9114-4cea-9263-c338fd3490cc" label="ambiguous">C</l><l xml:id="m-a8178952-d49c-434a-9ef5-23a435c69779" facs="#m-1eb3e62e-2891-4f08-8270-124bf9970945" label="lyrics-like">quaérat, et júdicet. Eu o u a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-74a6514d-e6bd-43f9-aa2a-a57b8373b392" facs="#m-509030a6-f4fd-4f96-aa1e-2bd556de17cf" label="text-like">Chanter of Vespers. Fratres: Christus assistens. p. 575. Short Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-95664082-3b70-4cc9-9ef4-3673ef8be0d1" facs="#m-91356422-71e4-452c-a5dc-6539d963ac50" label="lyrics-like">Erue a frâmea. V. De ôre leónis. p. 2</l><l xml:id="m-cdd234ee-b4b4-4f83-8354-464b58f948f8" facs="#m-9efa3f06-311a-4182-ae88-4f5bd286b457" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-2fb05900-55a8-47b5-b65a-7089e7001d9f" facs="#m-9621a8db-ba9b-43dc-8d65-4f5df0d10d9e" label="ambiguous">intr.</l><l xml:id="m-6f8ee0d5-cd6d-4807-ab5d-cd59720893dd" facs="#m-fcfa6fd2-a058-499d-8709-25f9789d1547" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-9b75894a-2d9f-4279-b873-04a5a89ea567" facs="#m-6b7800a6-d816-4959-9906-cb68872e1cde" label="ambiguous">d</l><l xml:id="m-359317a8-9448-4048-bfb5-70497b8c4549" facs="#m-784c450a-660d-4c80-95f6-8bfe9790dd9b" label="lyrics-like">U-di-ca me “ Dé¬ us,</l><l xml:id="m-766945b1-9a82-410c-9ca5-d6897d4bd295" facs="#m-54b1a132-3ca0-4346-8f97-dee18f29048b" label="lyrics-like">et dis- cérne cáu-sam</l><l xml:id="m-ee8dacea-b3f6-4489-af02-1dc450fb5f1d" facs="#m-f932b1c0-3bdc-464c-80d8-c639ff709c54" label="lyrics-like">ab hó-mine in-</l><l xml:id="m-11067db8-3456-4a3a-84c3-2a8c6e1a8bb3" facs="#m-dd24082e-5b43-46fc-afa9-7e0fe98f43b2" label="lyrics-like">mé¬ am de génte non sán-cta:</l><l xml:id="m-2ddb946d-55c1-4a84-bc15-09dc6739516a" facs="#m-b2e0eaab-127e-46e5-842a-881654224d79" label="lyrics-like">et do ló¬ s é-ripe</l><l xml:id="m-46f2d5c8-909b-4528-822d-5b7376e09d45" facs="#m-c6b5d441-9fc9-422b-a477-8d8f0508d24f" label="lyrics-like">es Dé¬ us</l><l xml:id="m-f6fbf120-bb91-4fec-a6de-e2d29834850b" facs="#m-8f0ae44d-37a0-44c0-8968-3a7695fc0eac" label="ambiguous">me: qui-a tu</l><l xml:id="m-e9435e86-3e7a-4c87-8f0c-29c016d2e961" facs="#m-81a9732b-4c50-4d43-88bb-6323cb450106" label="ambiguous">quo</l></lg>
